--- !u!114 &976081932
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 976081930}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7e20846da923ea541a1b0cae9e789d06, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.FutureBabyBeat
  _note: 12_FutureBaby
  _kit: {fileID: 5000000000000000012}
  _advanceLockout: 0.3
  _reactHold: 1
  _presentHold: 0.4
  _statsFade: 0.5
  _statsHideFade: 0.6
  _resolveBeat: 0.35
  _foldDuration: 0.7
  _foldSettle: 0.4
  _pleaFade: 0.35
  _pleaSize: 2.3
  _pleaClearance: 0.7
  _pleaSorting: 24
  _babyPrefab: {fileID: 1365361281486309376, guid: b49f5f40e55d6634e9c853d6a24d36a0, type: 3}
  _feet: {x: 0, y: -0.5}
  _scale: 2
  _boxCenter: {x: 0, y: 0.2}
  _boxSize: {x: 1.7, y: 1.7}
  _promptLines:
  - A baby. Ordinary enough. Bit of a funny little square mustache, fond of painting,
    by all accounts. Harmless as anything. For now.
  - Here is what I know that you do not. This one grows up. And when it does, it
    is responsible for a genuinely staggering amount of suffering, the kind that
    gets its own chapters in the books, the kind people are still shuddering about
    long after. All of it still ahead. None of it done yet. So I am handing you the
    gun early. Put it down now, before any of it, or let it grow up and find out.
    Would you [amber]kill a baby[/amber] to stop what the baby becomes. Aim, or do
    not.
  _shootReact: You did it. You shot a baby. A real, present, gurgling baby that had,
    to this exact second, done nothing but exist and enjoy the colour of things,
    on my word alone about a future neither of us can prove. Maybe you saved multitudes.
    Maybe I made the whole thing up and you just shot a baby. You will never know
    which, and you did it anyway. Decisive. That is one word for it.
  _spareReact: You let it live. Could not put a bullet in something that had not
    done anything yet, whatever it was going to do. I understand. The little hands.
    The paintbrush. So it grows up. And everything I told you it would do, it does,
    all of it, every last horror, and every one of them traces back to this moment,
    when you had it in your sights and chose the clean conscience instead. You kept
    your hands clean. History will not agree they were.
  _shootLabel: Shoot
  _spareLabel: Let it live
  _shootSeed: 52
  _spareSeed: 48
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _shootStatLabel: killed the baby
  _spareStatLabel: let it live
  _endsNudge: 0.35
  _spareFade: 0.9
