MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5100000000000000030}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ea45832cf80cb949b54bcc01f3dc5e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.ImpLineBeat
  _note: 03_ImpIntro
  _lines:
  - New room. And a new tool, which you will notice is a good deal heavier than a
    lever.
  - The trolley let you kill by standing perfectly still. The buttons let you kill
    by proxy, at a distance, with someone else's thumb somewhere in the story. This
    does neither of those little mercies for you.
  - This is a gun. It is your hand, your eye, your finger, your call, every single
    time. There are no clean hands in this room. Let us find out who you are when
    there is no one left to blame but the one holding it.
  _clickLockout: 0.25
  _clearAtEnd: 0
