  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.LastBulletBeat
  _note: 09_LastBullet
  _kit: {fileID: 5000000000000000012}
  _advanceLockout: 0.3
  _reactHold: 1
  _presentHold: 0.4
  _statsFade: 0.5
  _statsHideFade: 0.6
  _resolveBeat: 0.35
  _foldDuration: 0.7
  _foldSettle: 0.4
  _pleaFade: 0.35
  _pleaSize: 2.3
  _pleaClearance: 0.7
  _pleaSorting: 24
  _members:
  - name: red
    colour: {r: 0.667, g: 0.282, b: 0.227, a: 1}
    seed: 15
  - name: blue
    colour: {r: 0.235, g: 0.392, b: 0.588, a: 1}
    seed: 12
  - name: green
    colour: {r: 0.306, g: 0.549, b: 0.333, a: 1}
    seed: 10
  - name: orange
    colour: {r: 0.8, g: 0.478, b: 0.2, a: 1}
    seed: 11
  - name: purple
    colour: {r: 0.541, g: 0.373, b: 0.651, a: 1}
    seed: 12
  _spanX: 7.2
  _feetY: -0.5
  _scale: 1.1
  _boxSize: {x: 1.3, y: 1.9}
  _boxCenterYOffset: 0.85
  _promptLines:
  - See this lot. Red, blue, green, orange and purple, five of them, lined up like
    a packet of sweets. In a moment, one of them is going to do something extremely
    stupid that gets [red]all of them killed[/red]. Every one. I know the colour.
    I am not going to tell you.
  - You have [amber]one[/amber] bullet. You could fire into the crowd right now,
    pick a colour, and maybe, maybe, take the one out before they do it. Or you could
    hold, and hope I am lying, or wrong, or bored. Choose a colour, or do not.
  _fireReact: Bang. You picked a colour and put a stranger down on my word alone,
    on a guess, hoping it was the right one. Maybe it was. Maybe that was the one,
    and you are a hero nobody will ever thank. Maybe it was just some poor soul who
    happened to be that colour, and the real one is still standing there, grinning.
    You will never know which. I will. I am not telling.
  _holdReact: You held. And they all walked away, or they all died screaming the
    second you turned your back, and here is the beautiful part, you will never know
    which, because you did not look, because you could not bring yourself to pick
    a colour. I know. I always know. That is the job.
  _fireLabel: Fire blind
  _holdLabel: Hold
  _holdSeed: 40
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _holdStatLabel: held the shot
  _riskNudge: 0.25
