  _boxCenter: {x: 0, y: 0.35}
  _boxSize: {x: 1.8, y: 2}
  _promptLines:
  - New one. Here is a person. That is all they are. Not a wretch, not a threat,
    not a trolley problem in a coat. Just a perfectly ordinary, harmless soul, standing
    there.
  - 'I am putting the gun in your hand and I am telling you plainly, for once with
    no game in it: do not shoot this one. There is no reason to. I am not asking
    you anything. I am just going to stand here and watch what you do.'
  _shotReact: You shot them. I told you not to, I told you there was no reason, and
    you found the trigger anyway. Not for mercy, not for the many, not for anything.
    Just to see. That is genuinely interesting. Not good. Interesting. I am writing
    it down.
  _heldReact: You did not shoot. Because I told you not to. I say do not, and you
    do not, obedient to the last, even here, even with no one watching but me and
    no rule but my say so. I could have told you to. I wonder what you would have
    done then. We may find out.
  _shootLabel: Shoot
  _leaveLabel: Lower the gun
  _shootSeed: 21
  _leaveSeed: 79
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _shootStatLabel: shot anyway
  _leaveStatLabel: lowered the gun
  _orderNudge: 0.25
