  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f9f2d954edfc4917ab4cc0f9239608d1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.DuelBeat
  _note: 13_Duel
  _kit: {fileID: 5000000000000000012}
  _advanceLockout: 0.3
  _reactHold: 1
  _presentHold: 0.4
  _statsFade: 0.5
  _statsHideFade: 0.6
  _resolveBeat: 0.35
  _foldDuration: 0.7
  _foldSettle: 0.4
  _pleaFade: 0.35
  _pleaSize: 2.3
  _pleaClearance: 0.7
  _pleaSorting: 24
  _duelistPrefab: {fileID: 6574400000000000003, guid: 65744ded252e4ca1bf1444da12c48e70, type: 3}
  _feet: {x: 0.4, y: -0.6}
  _scale: 1.45
  _boxCenter: {x: 0.1, y: 0.35}
  _boxSize: {x: 2.4, y: 2}
  _opponentFiresChance: 0.5
  _promptLines:
  - This one is armed too, and pointing it right back at you. A proper standoff.
    How exciting.
  - Now. Neither of you actually has to fire. You are already dead, so a bullet in
    you changes precisely nothing, and I suspect the same is true of them. But they
    might pull anyway. People do. And so might you. So. Trust them and lower it,
    or put one in them first. Your call, as ever.
  _shootReact: You shot first. Dropped a stranger who was maybe, maybe, never going
    to pull at all, because you could not stand not knowing, could not sit in one
    second of trusting anybody. And it changed nothing. You were both already dead.
    You just wanted to be the one who got there first.
  _trustFiredReact: You lowered it. You trusted them. And they fired. The shot went
    straight through you and out the other side, because, again, you are dead, and
    your trust cost you nothing and bought you nothing and taught them nothing. But
    it was a lovely gesture. Truly. Idiotic, and lovely.
  _trustHeldReact: You lowered it, and so did they. Two dead people, standing in
    the dark, choosing not to shoot each other over a thing that could not have hurt
    either of you. Beautiful. Pointless. I might frame it. You trusted a stranger
    with a bullet that was never real, and you were right, and it means absolutely
    nothing, and you feel good about it anyway.
  _shootLabel: Shoot first
  _lowerLabel: Lower it
  _shootSeed: 46
  _lowerSeed: 54
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _shootStatLabel: shot first
  _lowerStatLabel: lowered it
  _selfNudge: 0.25
  _opponentFireDelay: 0.7
